  "sourceCaveats": [
    "Solar operational/planned tables have two sections without per-row development status; sourceSection preserves numbering without inferring status.",
    "The 2021 wind unit table says New for 2020; its site table says New for 2021. These source years are retained separately.",
    "2021 wind key flags four site IDs and twelve unit rows as modeled as queued using an explicit cell-shading legend. No such legend is supplied in the 2022 key.",
